# Copy to .env.local. Where the API lives. Read when Next.js starts (the `/api` rewrite in
# next.config.ts is fixed then) and by the server-side client on every request; no
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix, so the browser never sees it. Required in production: the server refuses
# to start without it there.
API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
